    "intro_narrative": "The ash clouds haven't parted in decades. You stand inside Sector 7's abandoned tech-bunker, the last known location of an intact power core that could save your settlement. The facility is a graveyard of pre-collapse technology, covered in irradiated dust but faintly humming with residual power. To survive the coming radiation storm, you must reboot these dead systems, sift through corrupted archives, and physically manifest the key to your survival. The machines are old, but they still have a pulse. Find a way to unlock the core, or freeze forever in the wastes.",
    "narrative_style": "post_apocalyptic"
